@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Criar Plano Mensal
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Plano Pro Mensal",
  "code": "PRO_MONTHLY",
  "priceCents": 9990,
  "interval": "MONTHLY"
}

### Criar Plano Anual
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Plano Enterprise Anual",
  "code": "ENTERPRISE_YEARLY",
  "priceCents": 99900,
  "interval": "YEARLY"
}

### Listar planos ativos
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans
